  "description": "The sweet spot between racing, bikepacking, commuting and everything else in between, the RUUT should be chosen by anyone who expects their bike to cover a vast range of applications. What makes the RUUT exceptionally versatile is the unique TwinTip fork – a feature that allows you to fine tune the handling and set up your bike exactly the way you like – relaxed or racy, the choice is yours to make at any point in time.\n\nThe RUUT CF features a groundbreaking frame with a unique blend of lowered seat stays, a curved top tube, and a revolutionary, interrupted seat tube. This design enhances comfort, safety, and speed, moving beyond the classic frame triangle. With a slacker head tube angle, extended reach and higher stack, the bike offers increased stability and a more comfortable riding position than the earlier generations of the RUUT.\n\nThe RUUT CF1 is fitted with the tried-and-tested wireless SRAM Rival AXS groupset with ETAP shifters and an ergonomic Selle Italia Novus Super Boost saddle that sits on top of an extended RONDO carbon seat post that provides additional trail damping. The SPANK Wing 12 Vibrocore handlebar is another component that takes the edge out of roots and ruts and complements the overall forgiving feel of the bike.",
